{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56832","headline":"邢凤挑女仙诗 · 不详","name":"邢凤挑女仙诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"意态精神画亦难，不知何事出仙坛。\n此君堂上云深处，应与萧郎驾彩鸾。\n（见《绿窗新话》卷上《邢凤遇西湖女仙》）（按：此条原注出「商芸《小说》」，显误。\n邢凤事，见《沈下贤文集》卷四、《博异志》、《酉阳杂俎》卷十四及《太平广记》卷二八二引《异闻录》。\n《绿窗新话》所载，疑出宋人续拟。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56832.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56832","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}